#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:114
msgid "Import Scheme ..."
msgstr "Schema importeren..."

#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:115
msgid "Export Scheme ..."
msgstr "Schema exporteren..."

#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:116
msgid "Revise Component"
msgstr "Komponent nakieken"

#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:234
msgid ""
"Your current changes will be lost if you load another scheme before saving "
"this one"
msgstr ""
"Dien aktuelle Ännern kaamt Di weg, wenn Du en anner Schema laadst, ehr Du "
"dit sekert hest."

#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:235
msgid "Load Shortcurt Scheme"
msgstr "Kombinatschonen-Schema laden"

#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:236
msgid "Load"
msgstr "Laden"

#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:249
#, kde-format
msgid "This file (%1) does not exist. You can only select local files."
msgstr ""
"Dat gifft de Datei \"%1\" nich. Du kannst bloots lokaal Dateien utsöken."

#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:278 kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:301
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Message: %1\n"
"Error: %2"
msgstr ""
"Naricht: %1\n"
"Fehler: %2"

#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:283 kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:306
msgid "Failed to contact the KDE global shortcuts daemon\n"
msgstr ""
"De KDE-Dämoon för de globalen Tastkombinatschonen lett sik nich ansnacken\n"

#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:385
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This will remove all currently not active global shortcuts for %1 from this "
"list. %1 is removed too if no shortcut is left.\n"
"All global shortcuts will reregister themselves whenever they are activated "
"the next time!"
msgstr ""
"Dit deit all opstunns nich aktiev globaal Tastkombinatschonen för %1 ut "
"disse List weg. Wenn keen Tastkombinatschoon mehr övrig is, warrt ok %1 "
"wegdaan.\n"
"All globaal Tastkombinatschonen meldt sik automaatsch nieg in, wenn se "
"wedder anmaakt warrt."

#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:387
msgid "Clean component"
msgstr "Komponent leddigmaken"

